      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <h2 id="comparison" class="scroll-mt-24">How It Compares</h2>
        <p>
          The M5 sits between two natural comparison points: the M7 above
          it in Bowflex's own lineup, and an actual compact treadmill for
          readers still deciding between the two categories.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-50 text-left">
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Model</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Type</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-black text-gray-700 border-b border-gray-200">Resistance</th>
